    /// `build_settings_panel_lines(&effective_settings(base))` projection yields off the same resolved
    /// base — and NOTHING else: no command-palette overlay, no result line, no dismiss, no execution.
    /// Reproduces the listener arm without launching a renderer or executing a command-palette action.
